    "relocation-verified-10-work-record": {
      "id": "relocation-verified-10-work-record",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Relocation completed on September 16, 2026. The repository moved to /Users/Ford/Github Repos/Codecaine/utilities/sotto with identical HEAD and Git worktree state at the move boundary. Both submodules resolve. Old build caches were preserved in .local/relocation-backup/build-cache, and the next build uses fresh paths. Server and archive plists, launcher copies, archive installation metadata, setup outputs, and Docs discovery use the new path. The dataset stayed at /Users/Ford/Transcripts. All six archive tests passed after the move. Qwen required one retry after its first cold start; both inference engines and the archive worker then reported healthy. All 26 native Docs pages pass completion checks and the link checker reports zero stale references."
